<title>PORTUGAL: TAP, Air Macau sign code sharing pact.</title>
<headline>TAP, Air Macau sign code sharing pact.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>TAP-Air Portugal and Air Macau have signed a code sharing agreement for the link between Macau and Bangkok, effective from this month, TAP said.</p>
<p>&quot;In order to improve service to the southeast Asian markets, the two companies are the only ones that provide direct and regular air links between Thailand and Macau (three to four flights per week),&quot; a statement said.</p>
<p>TAP operates Airbus 340s and Air Macau operates Airbus 320s on the route.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
